WEBVTT

00:01:50.978 --> 00:01:52.412
What's goin® on?

00:01:58.085 --> 00:01:59.917
I'll check it out.

00:02:04.925 --> 00:02:07.104
Sorry, Boss!

00:02:07.128 --> 00:02:09.072
You Hanayama-san?

00:02:09.096 --> 00:02:15.879
You're really famous! Everyone
I asked told me about ya!

00:02:15.903 --> 00:02:19.339
I hear you're a good fighter!

00:02:35.256 --> 00:02:38.226
Let's get this party started!

00:02:46.400 --> 00:02:49.267
Stop tr yin' to act cool!

00:03:00.181 --> 00:03:06.177
"Fearless Man™

00:03:06.420 --> 00:03:07.683
Boss!

00:03:10.224 --> 00:03:12.420
You really are strong!

00:03:25.439 --> 00:03:27.168
Crap! It's the cops!

00:03:27.775 --> 00:03:30.540
Some wimp told 'em about the desk!

00:03:34.548 --> 00:03:36.141
What's going on here?!

00:03:38.018 --> 00:03:40.163
What on earth is going on here?

00:03:40.187 --> 00:03:43.500
Yeah, sorry about that. Our
hew guy was carrying a desk

00:03:43.524 --> 00:03:44.935
when he tripped.

00:03:44.959 --> 00:03:49.439
Tripped? Is that the best you can do?

00:03:49.463 --> 00:03:52.275
Word has it you've been at
odds with Yajima's group.

00:03:52.299 --> 00:03:54.377
Seems fishy to me...

00:03:54.401 --> 00:03:59.271
What ever do you mean? We run
a serious organization here.

00:03:59.974 --> 00:04:03.103
Being kicked around can't be much fun.

00:04:03.644 --> 00:04:06.545
Tell me whenever you're
ready for a rematch.

00:04:35.676 --> 00:04:38.989
How'd you know I was
at Hanayama's place?

00:04:39.013 --> 00:04:41.448
Your mother said you would be there.

00:04:44.018 --> 00:04:49.479
Please be careful. You're dealing
with professional gangsters.

00:04:50.524 --> 00:04:54.188
As if I can fight a gang politely.

00:04:55.529 --> 00:04:57.207
A sound argument.

00:04:57.231 --> 00:05:01.378
Martial arts have no purpose
if they yield to brute force.

00:05:01.402 --> 00:05:05.815
Kuriyagawa-san. The world sure is big.

00:05:05.839 --> 00:05:06.897
Huh?

00:05:07.975 --> 00:05:11.955
To think that such
strong people exist...!

00:05:11.979 --> 00:05:15.158
To be honest, my legs were shaking.

00:05:15.182 --> 00:05:16.274
Boss...!

00:05:18.652 --> 00:05:21.485
--No, it was just some-
--Boss...!

00:05:44.378 --> 00:05:50.594
No one has ever put the boss
onto his hands and knees.

00:05:50.618 --> 00:05:53.063
He's never been knocked down!

00:05:53.087 --> 00:05:57.934
And for us, his strength is the
very pride of our organization.

00:05:57.958 --> 00:06:03.260
Yet, that little runt
KO'ed it with one blow!

00:06:27.554 --> 00:06:30.114
No way...!

00:06:39.667 --> 00:06:41.478
He's a monster!

00:06:41.502 --> 00:06:43.213
He's getting away!

00:06:43.237 --> 00:06:47.350
He tore apart his own car.
Nothing we can do.

00:06:47.374 --> 00:06:48.603
But...!

00:06:49.009 --> 00:06:52.188
Look. He's really something.

00:06:52.212 --> 00:06:57.961
A 15 year old kid scrapped a
Cadillac in the blink of an eye.

00:06:57.985 --> 00:07:01.148
His strength should be
a national treasure...

00:07:44.531 --> 00:07:45.965
Brother...

00:07:49.603 --> 00:07:51.081
Nina...

00:07:51.105 --> 00:07:55.785
You're really sweating.
That dream again?

00:07:55.809 --> 00:07:58.176
You're pathetic, Yuri.

00:07:59.380 --> 00:08:01.712
I could hear ya from outside.

00:08:02.716 --> 00:08:04.013
Sir...!

00:08:08.389 --> 00:08:12.569
Without me, you're just
some foreign boxer.

00:08:12.593 --> 00:08:18.208
You can't do anything by yourself.
Basically, you're my pet dog.

00:08:18.232 --> 00:08:24.214
Be that as it may, I am still a Xigil.

00:08:24.238 --> 00:08:26.483
You still stuck on that?!

00:08:26.507 --> 00:08:32.222
I cannot turn my back on any battle!
I have my pride as a warrior!

00:08:32.246 --> 00:08:36.493
And what has your crappy
pride gotten you?!

00:08:36.517 --> 00:08:38.110
What are you doing?!

00:08:40.287 --> 00:08:42.298
Nina-chan, was it?

00:08:42.322 --> 00:08:45.335
It must be tough having
such a dumb brother.

00:08:45.359 --> 00:08:46.569
Let Nina go!

00:08:46.593 --> 00:08:49.339
How about you work in his place?

00:08:49.363 --> 00:08:50.853
How dare you...!

00:08:51.598 --> 00:08:56.212
That's what any loving sibling would do.

00:08:56.236 --> 00:08:59.082
You got white skin, and
your looks ain't so bad.

00:08:59.106 --> 00:09:02.018
--You could start work right away.
--Stop it!

00:09:02.042 --> 00:09:06.172
You're worthless now
that you're in pieces!

00:09:08.482 --> 00:09:09.745
Baki!

00:09:10.050 --> 00:09:11.227
Let go!

00:09:11.251 --> 00:09:15.565
Did you know that it's
surprisingly easy to rip an ear off

00:09:15.589 --> 00:09:18.368
by pulling it forward from behind?

00:09:18.392 --> 00:09:21.054
--Want me to try?
--Stop...!

00:09:23.397 --> 00:09:25.058
Get lost!

00:09:26.633 --> 00:09:29.762
--You'll pay for this!
--Yeah, sure!

00:09:30.804 --> 00:09:34.672
--Baki...
--You're still alive!

00:09:39.880 --> 00:09:45.261
Got my arm broken.
Seems my boxing days are over...

00:09:45.285 --> 00:09:48.255
I've lost my dream...

00:09:49.423 --> 00:09:53.903
Comes with the territory.
You are a fighter.

00:09:53.927 --> 00:09:55.405
How rude...!

00:09:55.429 --> 00:09:59.627
--It's okay, Nina. He's right.
--Brother...

00:09:59.933 --> 00:10:02.959
--After all, I am-
--a warrior.

00:10:04.805 --> 00:10:07.740
I'll get "im.

00:10:08.842 --> 00:10:13.223
Do as you wish. You are a fighter.

00:10:13.247 --> 00:10:15.648
Yeah, that I am.

00:10:40.741 --> 00:10:42.051
Master Kaoru...

00:10:42.075 --> 00:10:43.941
--Wait here.
--Yes, sir.

00:10:56.156 --> 00:10:58.853
Madam, Master Kaoru is here.

00:11:11.939 --> 00:11:15.637
<i>Ka... 0.0 Tu...</i>

00:11:27.821 --> 00:11:33.225
--You smell good, Mom!
--It's French perfume.

00:11:34.127 --> 00:11:38.041
It's called Lyman, and
it's made from roses.

00:11:38.065 --> 00:11:43.162
<i>--You like roses, Mom?
--Yes, I love them!</i>

00:12:29.716 --> 00:12:30.979
Boss.

00:12:32.185 --> 00:12:35.553
Baki Hanma will die.

00:12:52.072 --> 00:12:55.018
Well, Yuri-san. I'll be back.

00:12:55.042 --> 00:12:58.054
--You're leaving?
--Please relax here!

00:12:58.078 --> 00:13:01.224
I'd love to, but another time.

00:13:01.248 --> 00:13:04.627
Get better soon. Then we can fight again.

00:13:04.651 --> 00:13:06.796
But I won't lose next time!

00:13:06.820 --> 00:13:09.065
I will. Thank you.

00:13:09.089 --> 00:13:11.319
--Later, then!
--Baki.

00:13:12.626 --> 00:13:17.206
Baki... About the technique he uses...

00:13:17.230 --> 00:13:18.789
Yuri-san...

00:13:20.067 --> 00:13:24.026
Xigil warriors aren't talkative, right?

00:13:31.211 --> 00:13:33.990
You're really amazing.

00:13:34.014 --> 00:13:36.826
I met 'im a while back.

00:13:36.850 --> 00:13:41.998
Looked like he'd killed
and eaten 2 or 3 people...

00:13:42.022 --> 00:13:45.368
I was shaking bad, to be honest...

00:13:45.392 --> 00:13:49.272
But you seem happy. Even
more so than when we sparred.

00:13:49.296 --> 00:13:50.821
Just a little more!

00:13:52.799 --> 00:13:56.879
Even now, just thinking about
fighting him makes me shake.

00:13:56.903 --> 00:13:59.849
But this is different than before.

00:13:59.873 --> 00:14:03.275
Fighting super-strong
guys gets me excited!

00:14:06.346 --> 00:14:10.393
Anyway, I'll be back! Nina-san,
sorry for not bringing a gift!

00:14:10.417 --> 00:14:13.182
I'll bring something awesome next time!

00:14:14.354 --> 00:14:19.485
I think I understand why
you called him a warrior...

00:14:21.428 --> 00:14:22.793
Baki...

00:14:23.163 --> 00:14:25.154
Don't let him catch you...I

00:14:27.667 --> 00:14:31.481
Kaoru Hanayama disappeared
three days ago.

00:14:31.505 --> 00:14:35.284
Nobody at his office
knows where he is.

00:14:35.308 --> 00:14:38.107
It would appear he's
finally making a move.

00:15:08.074 --> 00:15:13.069
I've known for a little while now...

00:15:14.748 --> 00:15:18.048
He's been after me...!

00:15:19.386 --> 00:15:24.119
He's out to get me...!

00:15:28.662 --> 00:15:29.959
The day before yesterday...

00:15:34.067 --> 00:15:35.762
Yesterday...

00:15:37.671 --> 00:15:40.606
And then this morning...!

00:15:42.108 --> 00:15:45.078
He's getting closer and closer...

00:15:53.854 --> 00:15:58.815
Fights are different from matches.

00:16:01.628 --> 00:16:04.689
The worse the situation, the better.

00:16:05.599 --> 00:16:07.499
Dark...

00:16:09.870 --> 00:16:11.838
dively...

00:16:14.641 --> 00:16:19.511
...and dangerous places are the best!

00:16:21.548 --> 00:16:25.712
And the more spectators, the better!

00:16:34.761 --> 00:16:38.061
Hanayama-san. Let's do it here!

00:16:38.999 --> 00:16:41.696
Baki!

00:16:48.942 --> 00:16:54.278
It's a fight! A gangster versus a brat!

00:16:57.117 --> 00:16:59.176
Ouch...!

00:17:14.834 --> 00:17:17.963
This guy's even stronger than...

00:17:20.974 --> 00:17:23.409
...the Yasha Ape!

00:17:25.178 --> 00:17:28.705
Someone stop him...!

00:17:36.523 --> 00:17:38.651
Nice of you to join us.

00:17:40.160 --> 00:17:42.305
But you're not seriously-

00:17:42.329 --> 00:17:47.392
I told you - we do things our way.

00:17:50.904 --> 00:17:55.785
Even with the Hanma name,
a son is just a son.

00:17:55.809 --> 00:18:00.610
He just had bad luck.
No, maybe the worst luck.

00:18:02.716 --> 00:18:05.761
What an incredible pummel attack!

00:18:05.785 --> 00:18:11.000
I can't believe there's anyone
this strong besides Dad...!

00:18:11.024 --> 00:18:13.459
My blocks aren't-

00:18:24.237 --> 00:18:28.333
Oh, no! The gangster
unleashed one helluva kick!

00:18:29.743 --> 00:18:31.472
You alive?

00:18:41.087 --> 00:18:44.455
--Is he trying to kill him?!
--So what if he is?

00:18:45.358 --> 00:18:49.693
--Hey! Someone stop him!
--Yeah, right! That'd be a death sentence!

00:18:50.697 --> 00:18:54.361
--Throwing him outside, huh?
--What?!

00:19:07.714 --> 00:19:09.658
He went right through!

00:19:09.682 --> 00:19:11.794
He threw him out...!

00:19:11.818 --> 00:19:14.412
Don't forget to pay up.

00:19:23.129 --> 00:19:24.673
Hey...!

00:19:24.697 --> 00:19:26.131
What...?!

00:19:27.667 --> 00:19:30.830
Whoa! He climbed back up!

00:19:31.471 --> 00:19:34.270
Not bad, Chief!

00:19:37.744 --> 00:19:40.623
You may have more
experience than me,

00:19:40.647 --> 00:19:45.895
but I've fought to the
death before, too!

00:19:45.919 --> 00:19:50.413
--He still wants to fight!
--Don't lose, kid!

00:19:59.799 --> 00:20:02.825
<i>Doesn't he defend?!</i>

00:20:21.187 --> 00:20:22.882
His arm...!

00:20:24.057 --> 00:20:26.268
That smarts.

00:20:26.292 --> 00:20:29.523
So your grip strength's your specialty?

00:20:37.003 --> 00:20:38.714
My word...!

00:20:38.738 --> 00:20:43.767
His speed has increased several-fold
since training in the mountains...!

00:20:49.048 --> 00:20:51.949
--A clean hit below the nose!
--Boss!

00:21:11.204 --> 00:21:15.384
--That was sweet!
--Not bad!

00:21:15.408 --> 00:21:19.038
--Check it out!
--Talk about lame!

00:21:41.301 --> 00:21:43.770
--What the heck?!
--Whoa...!

00:21:55.281 --> 00:21:58.546
What's with that tattoo...?!

00:22:44.731 --> 00:22:50.279
The hazy afternoon in the winter sun

00:22:50.303 --> 00:22:55.884
<i>hangs onto love in one
corner of the pavement</i>

00:22:55.908 --> 00:23:01.557
When I blew on my cold hands

00:23:01.581 --> 00:23:06.562
a tiny bit of courage swelled up.

00:23:06.586 --> 00:23:12.101
Today will certainly be wonderful,

00:23:12.125 --> 00:23:17.640
<i>gently enveloped in love</i>

00:23:17.664 --> 00:23:23.312
There are some strange feelings too,

00:23:23.336 --> 00:23:28.851
but they will be reborn

00:23:28.875 --> 00:23:34.523
Today will certainly be wonderful;

00:23:34.547 --> 00:23:40.145
they will be reborn as even more love.

00:23:49.962 --> 00:23:51.828
"Next Episode™

00:23:52.899 --> 00:23:56.078
The fight is ended with fists.

00:23:56.102 --> 00:24:00.664
The two blast their ways through
their own little universe.

00:24:01.541 --> 00:24:07.623
The moment the murderous fist
strikes its prey, all is crushed.

00:24:07.647 --> 00:24:14.897
Will the martial artist be the chosen
one, or the brawler? And then...

00:24:14.921 --> 00:24:19.757
"Next Episode: A Clash of Fists!™
